 YesOrNoWithBigFontWithInitialVgap;parms
⍝ Presents a "Yes" and a "No" button with a big font
 parms←##.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo
 parms.(fontStandard fontInput)←2⍴⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Courier New')('Size' 30))
 parms.initialVgap←50

 ⎕←parms ##.APLGUI.Dialogs.YesOrNo'Are you really sure about this?'
